{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9c3c0da5b891e380104db038955989498e05dd514dc7405c944d0990ec08e6bf", "ja": "そうだろうな。杏奈のゲーミングカレー、\nかなり話題になってるし。売り上げも好調らしいぞ。", "zh": "确实如此。杏奈的游戏咖喱最近相当受关注，听说销量也很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "6033213aef4d1f4cae1a2a0884546423dc1a5f03b7de25e609fb8032bd440bef", "ja": "ん……。可奈と莉緒さんに……。\nいっぱい、助けてもらった、から……。", "zh": "嗯……。因为可奈和莉绪姐……\n帮了杏奈……很多忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "54942c50dab15e03092a6d2a654dc33d1713bf09c188c2133dd2d2611ab97ef5", "ja": "ふたりのためにも……。\n話題になってくれて、うれしい、です……。", "zh": "也是为了她们两个人……能成为话题，我很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a78ea7a759295f704bae1d5c79bf39bb76d822e402df4d7efc0dd66a2e13636c", "ja": "そうだな、ふたりも色々考えてくれてたし。\nみんなで作ったカレーだな。", "zh": "是啊，她们俩也为此想了很多。\n这是大家一起做的咖喱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "1837835720878cb684a4bbc34e9bceee2db70f749bb238f305e83253af2e4ef9", "ja": "うん……♪　杏奈が、ひとりで悩んでたときに……。\n感想を、くれて……すごく、助かりました……。", "zh": "嗯……♪　在杏奈一个人烦恼的时候……\n给了我感想……真的帮了很大忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "a2358db59765a76c4a32040aef1d6daf045779d153aeb62577d5b4eda97c6f7a", "ja": "それに……おいしいって、言ってもらえて……。\nうれしかった……♪", "zh": "而且……能听到你说好吃……真的很开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c740c5096aeb77bec46f1ae816ac1aae3dfb2761a49aff9edde6ca6bdfd2a11c", "ja": "わかるよ。一生懸命作ったものだからこそ、\n感想がもらえたら嬉しいよな。", "zh": "我懂。正因为是费尽心思做出来的东西，\n能听到对方的感想，当然会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "51e4baa203b56064e5fed206857b2f6fab0ad815d7d3c05ab5a266814f33cca5", "ja": "はい……。杏奈、最初は……。\n手軽なカレーにしようとしか、考えて、なくて……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈一开始……只想着做一道简单方便的咖喱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "72f442dfbf4f445a9f023f32c6802bf02e6d4624aa8f9769203713995a603d8a", "ja": "でも……たくさんの人が、食べるから……。\nみんなのことも、考えないとって……。", "zh": "可是……要让很多人吃……所以也得考虑大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "23cabac50e03d87ab0f4d9d243da66b2347f91069233bdf52bb840177788b336", "ja": "そんなふうに、考えられたのも、ふたりのおかげ、\nだから……たくさん、お礼、言わなきゃ……。", "zh": "能这样考虑，也是多亏了你们两个，\n所以……得好好道谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5f676207752f9a5c27ad967b9d704e126d3dc1dfd0aad5a8893994a91f0e3d0b", "ja": "そうだな。でも俺からも、杏奈にお礼を言いたいな。\nありがとう。ユニットを引っ張ってくれて。", "zh": "是啊。不过我也想向杏奈道谢。\n谢谢你带领着组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "f64198519f37e73003476d1cb28dafed4d29f500c799f24df3fa18ec5d9bbfab", "ja": "ううん……杏奈こそ。\n楽しいお仕事、ありがとう……です。", "zh": "没有啦……杏奈才应该。\n谢谢你……带来了这么开心的一份工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "36b6062412283bf113f710df66fef76742cfe090cf9b8daac0ec1ee7a70614f6", "ja": "お礼に、今度。{$P$}さんには、\nスペシャルカレー……作ってあげる、ね……。", "zh": "作为答谢，下次……给{$P$}先生做特别咖喱……好不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "3b0e8dcb57aee6f8223a7051dabb7521deafc7a394131a765e66d4c606c159c8", "ja": "すっごく、刺激的なのに、するから……。\n楽しみにしてて、ください……♪", "zh": "我会做得特别刺激……让它变得非常有冲击力……你就期待一下吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0203_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6662e401b83972f0f215627a5018324976ad7cb19fda6aaf2c17db25d91b03d5", "ja": "（うん、楽しみだ！　甘くて、刺激的な味……。\n俺もすっかり、カレーのトリコになってしまったな！）", "zh": "（嗯，我很期待！又甜又刺激的味道……我也彻底成了咖喱的俘虏啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
